ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nAt a family gathering, everyone shares photos. Grandpa tells his grandson Xiao Ming, \"There are 60 photos here, most are travel photos, some are family photos, but there are almost no wedding photos.\" Xiao Ming flips through and finds only 15 family photos.\n\n[Question]\nHow many travel photos does Xiao Ming estimate before flipping through?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before flipping through, Xiao Ming estimates there are 50 travel photos.\nB. Before flipping through, Xiao Ming estimates there are 20 travel photos.\nC. Before flipping through, Xiao Ming estimates there are 59 travel photos.\nD. Before flipping through, Xiao Ming estimates there are 60 travel photos.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00970847848715727,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52afec2ddb05a7fe2f598","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452222536,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c5f9ba107c904bf9b49aeef5cac80386"}